From: HAOS Mi A2 port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm660-xiaomi-jasmine: force USB host mode

The ID pin (extcon-usb-gpio) is unreliable with USB-C hubs and dongles, which
leaves dwc3 in gadget mode. HAOS has no USB gadget use, so run it as host.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-jasmine.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-jasmine.dts
@@ -613,7 +613,7 @@
 	phys = <&qusb2phy0>;
 	phy-names = "usb2-phy";
 
-	dr_mode = "peripheral";
+	dr_mode = "host";
 	extcon = <&extcon_usb>;
 };
 
